window.products.push({"id":127237,"name":"Panasonic FV-WCCS2-W WhisperControl, Condensation Sensor Plus On/Off/Light Wall Switch, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ky2pgI2SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Panasonic FV-WCCS2-W WhisperControl Condensation Sensor Plus On/Off Wall Switch features intelligent sensor technology that monitors room temperature and humidity to anticipate dew point, automatically operating the fan to control moisture. Adjust the unit’s sensitivity based on your regional climate, the size of your bathroom and your preferred dryness level.Advanced, easy-to-use features include a Moisture Sensitivity Selector and an Adjustable Minutes Per Hour (MPH) fan timer. The Moisture Sensitivity Selector tracks temperature and humidity over several weeks to determine the level of dryness that your room needs to return to. The MPH fan timer provides controlled ventilation every hour and will credit any manual use time to the next hour's operation (up to 3 hours ahead). This credit for manual use saves energy by conserving heated or cooled air. During automatic operation, a 30-minute countdown timer initiates after moisture levels in the room return to a normal range. A 20-minute countdown timer initiates once the fan is manually turned on. Tough and rugged, with a max load capacity of 8 amps, the Condensation Sensor Plus is engineered to control current LED lighting and DC motor loads efficiently. It is ASHRAE, Energy Star, LEED and CALGreen compliant.Achieve quality air and energy efficiency with whisper-quiet sound levels for your spaces with the help of the Panasonic FV-WCCS2-W WhisperControl Condensation Sensor Plus On/Off Wall Switch. From the Manufacturer Panasonic FV-WCCS2 Whisper Control Condensation Sensor, Humidity Control and Countdown Timer, On/Off/Light Condensation Sensor - 3 Controls in 1 Humidity Control - Automatically turns on exhaust fan to control humidity. Advanced sensor technology detects relative humidity and temperature for superior accuracy. Fan automatically turns off when the appropriate combination of temperature and humidity is reached, in all climate zones and for all seasons.Countdown Timer - Manually turning the fan on initiates a 30 minute countdown cycle.Manual On/Off Control - Simply push the switch for manual fan operation and if you’ve turned your fan off before the room has been adequately cleared of moisture, the condensation sensor makes sure your exhaust fan clears the air. Additional Benefits Compatible with all Single Speed and/or Single Speed Lite ventilation products Stylish decorator design with wall plate included LED Indicator light 1 year limited warranty ASHRAE ENERGY STARQualified LEED and CAL Green compliant Ground: Grounding Feature: Blue LED Light Amperage: 15 Amp Maximum Fan Load: 1/8 hp or 3 Amps Voltage: 120 Volts Termination: 6-Inch Leads Connections (Copper Wire Connections): Use No.14 or No.12 Max. Fluorescent Light Load: 400 Watt Standard Certifications: UL/CSA Listed Warranty: 1 Year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ky2pgI2SL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Panasonic","source_asin":"B006L5QGJ2","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-127237","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B006L5QGJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B006L5QGJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
