window.products.push({"id":127290,"name":"Igloo 40 LB Automatic Dispensing Nugget Ice Maker, Portable, Countertop, Stainless Steel, for Home Use, Makes Small Chewable Cubes for Cold Water, Sod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o3ORTgPsL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Complete your beverage serving setup with this elegantly designed automatic nugget ice dispensing machine. This nugget ice maker looks great on countertops, bar tables, and any area where drinks and beverages are sold. Nugget ice is made automatically after filling the water tank with drinking water and turning the machine one. Why use nugget ice? Nugget ice pellets are small and soft. They soak up the flavor of beverage they float in and are a delight to chew on. The design of the nugget ice dispenser makes it easy to fill your container with ice with minimal jamming. It can hold up to 3 quarts of water, start making ice after 6 minutes, and in 24 hours can make up to 40 lbs of nugget ice. Automatic cleaning function is simple to use and keeps your machine running smoothly. Touch controls are clear and simple, with LED indicator lights to tell you when you need more water or are full of ice. This nugget ice maker fits almost anywhere in your home, making it a great and easily movable addition to your kitchen, dining room, rec room, and more!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81o3ORTgPsL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Igloo","source_asin":"B0B1FSSGXF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-127290","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1FSSGXF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1FSSGXF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
