window.products.push({"id":127645,"name":"Washer and Dryer Covers, Washing Machine Cover, Drier Protector, 29\"x28\"x40\", Set of 2, Black, Polyester, Waterproof, Dustproof, for Top Load & Front ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Q82C+blL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PROTECTIVE COVER AGAINST THE ELEMENTS: These heavy-duty polyester covers offer a full suite of protection against the most common elements that will add to your machine’s lifetime of wear and tear: dust, water, and sunlight. Treated to deflect UV rays, so if your machines sit under sunlight from a window during peak hours, it’ll be no problem. WINDOWED ZIPPERS: Peeking windows that can be accessed or closed via zippers. These zippers allow you to quickly check on your washer and dryer without having to trouble yourself with removing them. Because washers don't heat up like dryers, using these zippers allow you to continue to safely keep the washer covered even during use. UNIVERSALLY SIZED FIT: Both washer and dryer covers are 29\"x28\"x40\" which allow for near universal fitting over almost all standard U.S. washer and dryers. Now you can safely cover your washer and dryer and extend their longevity, reducing their overall exposure. DUAL DESIGN: Useable for both top loading and bottom loading machines. No matter the washer and no matter the dryer, both covered offer design and visibility to be useable, regardless of if your washer loads laundry through the top or through the bottom. EASY TO MAINTAIN: Woven fabric is specially made to not only resist and protect but also be easy to clean. Oxford weave not only allows liquid to roll off but allows even gentle wiping motions to easily clear most accumulated dust and grime to roll off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710Q82C+blL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Houseables","source_asin":"B09VYP2R5S","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-127645","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VYP2R5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VYP2R5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
