window.products.push({"id":127809,"name":"Colzer Portable Electronic Ice Maker Machine, Countertop Ice Maker,Make 9 Ice Cubes within 6-13 Minutes,33lbs Ice in 24 hours,Water Tank and Ice Scoop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gYw+GMTNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Colzer Portable Ice Maker: Colzer Portable ice machine produces bullet ice cubes, which doesn't have sharp edges and will not hurt people's mouth. 2 ice cube size-options (S/L) meet your different needs. Transparent window helps you observe the condition clearly. The integrated storage bin is well-insulated Easy & Fast: 9 bullet ice cubes in just 6-13 minutes, produce 33 lbs. of ice in 24 hours Compact & Portable: Colzer Ice Maker is compact, portable and works anywhere there is an outlet available, such as boat, kitchen, office, outdoors. Modern & Fashionable: ABS outlook easily blends in any families, bars, coffee shops... Specifications: Input voltage: 110V-120V/50-60 Hz Net Weight: 7.8KG Gross Weight:8.8kg Dimensions: 14.9*11.0*14.9inch(38x28x38cm) Kindly Notice: ☆This ice maker is insulated and by definition not a freezer. The ice cubes will not be frozen in the ice machine. Use a separate freezer for this purpose.  ★The innovative technology of the device can reuse molten water - saving time and water.  ☆The ice production may be poor in the first 5 rounds because the refrigeration system is not yet stably running. ★It is recommended to add water to the maximum water level, draining the air inside the pump ☆Please place the product on a stable, ventilated, clean countertop. ★Before usage, please check the drain plug and the inner silicone plug to prevent water leakage. ☆When the product starts to make ice, do not press other buttons frequently, to prevent the ice making process from being stopped. ★If a new machine does not make ice, it may be backflow of refrigerant caused by transportation. Please wait for 24 hours before using. ☆Better use pure or distilled water","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gYw+GMTNL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COLZER","source_asin":"B07PWQF712","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-127809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PWQF712","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PWQF712","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
